    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://cdm.ovh/rsm/schemes/side">
        <dc:creator>Airy Magnien</dc:creator>
        <dc:description>List of terms denoting the faces and sides of, typically, a box-like solid</dc:description>
        <dc:title xml:lang="en">Sides terminology</dc:title>
        <dcterms:created>2 April 2024</dcterms:created>
        <dcterms:license>https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/</dcterms:license>
        <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>side</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
        <vann:preferredNamespaceUri>https://cdm.ovh/rsm/schemes/side</vann:preferredNamespaceUri>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">designation of faces (left, right...) can be used in conjunction with the side of the faces (interior, exterior). Again, orientation and polarity shall be disambiguated by the context in which they are expressed.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Scheme of principal side designations relative to an intrinsic or contextual reference frame. Applicability depends on the geometry, function, or orientation of the entity concerned. The usage context should provide all necessary disambiguation.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


